(The humiliation of the older\054 poor in age\054 before the younger\054) Tj
T*
(well\055off in age\054 in families\054 clans and homes\056 The voice of the) Tj
T*
(knowers has grown hoarse in every time and place calling out) Tj
T*
(among people\072 \042This world tramples the dignity of those who) Tj
T*
(glorify wealth\054 as a punishment for them\054 because the Mighty is) Tj
T*
(Allah alone\042\054 but there is no life in the one you call \056\056 For I have) Tj
T*
(seen the young trample the dignity of one older than him\054 and) Tj
T*
(the one whose dignity is trampled silent\054 mute\054 shaken\054) Tj
T*
(submissive like a servant\073 rather\054 with time he befriends and) Tj
T*
(loves the one who tramples him\041) Tj
