(This is the world that has pleased most people\054 that they loved) Tj
T*
(and adored\054 and for which they spent the love of Allah and threw) Tj
T*
(it behind their backs\041 This is how we see it doing to people \056\056) Tj
T*
(making them very small while they think we do not see \056\056 Yes\054 by) Tj
T*
(Allah\054 we see very well with open eyes all the time\054 but we used) Tj
T*
(to be silent with grief\054 rage and sorrow over the one who) Tj
T*
(accepted being trampled\073 then\054 by Allah\054 we no longer ever) Tj
T*
(grieve over one who has accepted contempt and humiliation for) Tj
